  "behavior": [
    "Core Runtime supplies the Service-owned SQLite VconStore instead of MemoryVconStore; Store remains independent of Core types.",
    "Stable UUID, original exact Tenant/Conversation/Session, body/manifest and hashes bind creation atomically. Identical live revision-one retry recovers the original handle; changed intent/owner/revision/deletion cannot overwrite or resurrect.",
    "UUID/location selectors agree exactly; arbitrary URLs are local misses and never fetched. Foreign scopes miss. Exact read integrity and expected-handle checks retain one backend reservation in VconRead.",
    "Fair per-record cross-process custody is separate from Identity/Conversation authority. Tests retain reads while another Store handle/process attempts deletion; independent records proceed.",
    "Redaction uses the current canonical source/dependency transform. Exclusive original-operation CAS commits changed bytes and immutable mutation fact atomically, preserving historical exact redaction replay after later deletion.",
    "Local deletion removes live body/manifest columns, invalidates old live handles and retains a tombstone. Redaction-history capacity reserves a terminal deletion slot. This is not provider erasure or physical disk sanitization.",
    "Failed transforms and wrong expected digests leave original bytes and snapshot unchanged. Snapshot logical integrity includes both new tables; online backup/reopen recovers exact record body and manifest."
  ],
